# Cloud Build upload filter (separate from .dockerignore, which filters the Docker build context).
# Allowlist: data/chroma_index and data/papers.db ARE uploaded because the image bakes them in.
# .env, *.env.yaml, data/raw, docs, tests, eval and reference are never uploaded.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!app/
!app/**
!ingest/
!ingest/**
!data/
!data/papers.db
!data/chroma_index/
!data/chroma_index/**
# `!data/` re-includes the whole folder, so drop everything else in it again.
data/raw/
data/raw/**
data/*.json
data/repos/
data/*.tmp
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
